1. Removed the import of DataTableContext
2. Created the context directly in the preview file using createContext
3. Added a useDataTable hook that the FilterPopover component might be using internally
4. Kept all the mock provider functionality but now using our locally created context

This should resolve the import error while still providing the necessary context for the FilterPopover component to function properly.

